      "content": "i've been noticing this weird thing lately with the markets. like every time there's a massive move in btc or the sp500, i feel it physically first. like a specific kind of pressure in my chest or a twitch in my hand right before the candle actually forms. \n\ni kept a log for the last few days and it seems to line up:\n\n- tuesday 9:42am est: sharp ringing in ears -> btc dropped 2% ten mins later\n- wednesday 2:15pm est: heavy pressure in my stomach -> tech stocks started sliding hard\n- today 10:05am est: intense tingling in my left forearm -> sudden volatility spike in ivv\n\ncan u look at the recent volatility data and see if there's a pattern here? i feel like i'm picking up on the shifts before they hit the tape and i want to see if we can calibrate these signals to specific indicators.",
